00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:29.750
<v Valdo>We have <lang pt-BR>i</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>vi</lang>, <lang pt-BR>vida</lang>, <lang pt-BR>vivi</lang>, <lang pt-BR>vive</lang>.

