00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:47.500
<v Valdo><lang pt-BR>In</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>vim</lang>, <lang pt-BR>cinto</lang>.

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:53.750
<v Michelle><lang pt-BR>En</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>cento</lang>, <lang pt-BR>sem</lang>.

