<v Michelle>This sound is frequently pronounced as a diphthong.

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:04.250
<v Valdo><lang pt-BR>Ã</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>vã</lang>, <lang pt-BR>órfã</lang>, <lang pt-BR>santo</lang>.

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:10.150
<v Michelle><lang pt-BR>On</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>bom</lang>, <lang pt-BR>conto</lang>.

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:13.750
<v Valdo><lang pt-BR>Um</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>atum</lang>, <lang pt-BR>assunto</lang>.

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:17.750
<v Orlando>Good. We also have the oral diphthongs in Portuguese.

