<v Valdo><lang pt-BR>Ei</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>lei</lang>.

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:24.300
<v Michelle><lang pt-BR>Éi</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>papéis</lang>.

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:25.750
<v Valdo><lang pt-BR>Ai</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>pai</lang>.

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:29.550
<v Michelle><lang pt-BR>Ói</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>rói</lang>.

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:31.250
<v Valdo><lang pt-BR>Oi</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>boi</lang>.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:34.750
<v Michelle><lang pt-BR>Ui</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>cuidado</lang>.

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:36.750
<v Valdo><lang pt-BR>Iu</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>riu</lang>.

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:40.750
<v Michelle><lang pt-BR>Eu</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>deu</lang>.

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:43.250
<v Valdo><lang pt-BR>Éu</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>véu</lang>.

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:46.800
<v Michelle><lang pt-BR>Au</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>mau</lang>.

