<v Valdo><lang pt-BR>Ão</lang> as in <lang pt-BR>nação</lang>, <lang pt-BR>falam</lang>.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:19.500
<v Orlando>Great. Finally, let's turn over to José Luis, and we'd
